 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 1.2,
   "end": 9.712124999999999,
   "text": "This is TEMT, the Transportation Emission Measurement Tool from the TCI\u2013IIMB Supply Chain Sustainability Lab at IIM Bangalore."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.032124999999999,
   "end": 12.045957999999999,
   "text": "Here is the whole product, end to end."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.592124086196899,
   "end": 21.6289570861969,
   "text": "The website opens with a live walkthrough of what TEMT does: enter a shipment, get its footprint, compare cleaner modes, and report it."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.9489570861969,
   "end": 26.728415086196897,
   "text": "Below are the credentials, every module, and a lane comparison anyone can try."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.65912399845886,
   "end": 34.47016599845886,
   "text": "Open the app, and start with your company, the guided tour, or a sample workspace."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.79016599845886,
   "end": 38.63899899845886,
   "text": "Let's load the FMCG sample, labelled as sample data everywhere."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.090123992736814,
   "end": 45.35908199273681,
   "text": "The overview shows the year's well-to-wheel emissions, intensity per tonne-kilometre, and progress against your target."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.67908199273681,
   "end": 56.12291499273681,
   "text": "Each month splits into tank-to-wheel and well-to-tank, as ISO 14083 requires, followed by modes, business units, lanes and reduction opportunities."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.57412396031189,
   "end": 64.6104569603119,
   "text": "The quick calculator compares every practical mode, door to door. Pune to Kolkata by rail is about eighty-five percent lower than by truck."
  },
  {
   "start": 66.43012414532471,
   "end": 72.6247911453247,
   "text": "The calculator starts with the method: distance-based, or fuel-based when you have fuel records. Then pick the mode."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.94479114532471,
   "end": 81.75554114532471,
   "text": "Type a city, even an old name like Bangalore, or a PIN code, and TEMT calculates the distance. Or enter it manually from your trip sheet."
  },
  {
   "start": 82.0755411453247,
   "end": 90.70274914532472,
   "text": "Enter the cargo in tons, pick the truck, and the result shows the emission factor, intensity per ton, and every step, with the GLEC reference."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.02274914532471,
   "end": 96.8765821453247,
   "text": "The LR number and dispatch date are required, and saving the same LR number again updates that shipment."
  },
  {
   "start": 97.19658214532471,
   "end": 102.31949914532471,
   "text": "Fuel-based asks only for the fuel used: here, litres of diesel from a fuel card."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.8971241529541,
   "end": 117.83179115295411,
   "text": "For rail, search stations by name or code. TEMT measures the shortest route on the Indian Railways network, station to station: on average within about three percent of published route distances."
  },
  {
   "start": 118.1517911529541,
   "end": 127.21529115295411,
   "text": "Air searches only airports and sea only ports: flights use great-circle distances, and sea legs follow shipping lanes, by trade lane or vessel type."
  },
  {
   "start": 131.26712403851317,
   "end": 140.00845703851317,
   "text": "Compare modes ranks road, rail, air and coastal options for the same cargo, flags impractical ones, and saves your choice to the ledger."
  },
  {
   "start": 141.4211240823822,
   "end": 151.77345708238218,
   "text": "Many shipments make several stops. Pick a fixed route such as rail intermodal, with its modes set: here, Hosur to Guwahati, and TEMT picks the nearest stations."
  },
  {
   "start": 152.0934570823822,
   "end": 161.1905820823822,
   "text": "Or build your own: change the modes, and press plus on any leg to add a stop, up to twelve legs, with terminal handling counted at every stop."
  },
  {
   "start": 163.37412415104674,
   "end": 172.62958215104675,
   "text": "Bulk import has a template for each way you ship, from road and courier to rail, air, sea and inland waterways, with only the columns that mode needs."
  },
  {
   "start": 172.94958215104674,
   "end": 179.08824915104674,
   "text": "Every row is checked before saving, and a shipment whose LR number is already saved is updated, not duplicated."
  },
  {
   "start": 179.54012404042052,
   "end": 186.14312404042053,
   "text": "Every shipment lands in the ledger. Search, filter, and open any one to see its legs and calculation basis."
  },
  {
   "start": 188.73412404614257,
   "end": 196.59749904614256,
   "text": "Accounts are optional. Create one on its own page, with a strong password, and your workspace syncs securely across devices and colleagues."
  },
  {
   "start": 196.91749904614258,
   "end": 201.70654104614258,
   "text": "The server recalculates it independently, and your sessions and report history live here."
  },
  {
   "start": 204.19612393933104,
   "end": 213.80745693933105,
   "text": "Reports are read in the tool first: totals, trends by month, every business unit, mode and lane, down to the SEBI BRSR Principle 6 mapping."
  },
  {
   "start": 214.12745693933104,
   "end": 223.87078993933105,
   "text": "Then export them in six formats: PDF, Excel, Word, CSV, JSON and Power BI, each with the methodology and every factor used."
  },
  {
   "start": 228.34112415867614,
   "end": 233.87837415867614,
   "text": "A board-ready PDF, with charts, the BRSR table, methodology and factors."
  },
  {
   "start": 234.53912411289977,
   "end": 238.22799911289977,
   "text": "An Excel workbook with a sheet for every view, down to each leg."
  },
  {
   "start": 239.91412411289977,
   "end": 241.23812411289978,
   "text": "An editable Word report."
  },
  {
   "start": 242.8381241376953,
   "end": 246.1003321376953,
   "text": "A Power BI pack with a star schema and DAX measures."
  },
  {
   "start": 246.55212412434386,
   "end": 249.26395712434388,
   "text": "Plus CSV and JSON for any other system."
  },
  {
   "start": 249.7151239927368,
   "end": 258.3150819927368,
   "text": "The reduction planner tests rail shift, air to road, consolidation, electric trucks and load factors, and measures each lever against your target."
  },
  {
   "start": 258.76712403851315,
   "end": 269.8392910385131,
   "text": "The factor library lists every value TEMT applies, with its source: TEMT's own India-specific factors first, and the GLEC defaults alongside for comparison."
  },
  {
   "start": 270.1592910385132,
   "end": 276.0510830385131,
   "text": "Settings hold your NIFTY 500 company, targets, backups, and an optional local AI model."
  },
  {
   "start": 276.50212393360897,
   "end": 278.026456933609,
   "text": "The Copilot runs in your browser."
  },
  {
   "start": 278.346456933609,
   "end": 281.32878993360896,
   "text": "Twenty tonnes from Mumbai to Delhi by thirty-two foot truck."
  },
  {
   "start": 281.64878993360895,
   "end": 282.69453993360895,
   "text": "Compare that with rail."
  },
  {
   "start": 283.01453993360894,
   "end": 290.324122933609,
   "text": "Summarise FY 2025\u201326. It calculates, compares, analyses and exports, on request."
  },
  {
   "start": 290.7751239355163,
   "end": 293.66474893551634,
   "text": "And a fourteen-step guided tour explains every screen."
  },
  {
   "start": 296.2339930589752,
   "end": 304.4985350589752,
   "text": "TEMT: India-specific factors, ISO 14083 certification, and reports that stand up to scrutiny."
  },
  {
   "start": 304.8185350589752,
   "end": 306.15957705897523,
   "text": "Measure your next shipment today."
  }
 ],
